# Qt in ERDFlow @PROJECT_VERSION@

ERDFlow @PROJECT_VERSION@ uses Qt @ERDFLOW_QT_VERSION@, copyright The Qt Company Ltd.
and other contributors, under the GNU Lesser General Public License version 3
(`LGPL-3.0.txt`, which refers to the GNU General Public License version 3 in
`GPL-3.0.txt`).

- ERDFlow links to Qt dynamically. The Qt libraries and plugins are separate
  files in this package.
- They are the official Qt @ERDFLOW_QT_VERSION@ binaries from The Qt Company.
  Their code is unmodified; the packaging tools only set where they look for
  one another and, on macOS, sign them. `THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt` lists each
  of them, the exact Qt source revisions they were built from, and the
  compiler used.
- Nothing in ERDFlow's licence or terms limits your rights under the LGPL. In
  particular, you may replace the Qt libraries in this package with modified
  versions of your own, and reverse engineering for the purpose of debugging
  such modifications is permitted.

